  "_comment": "A slow reel, the counterpart to short-form-burst.json. Three effects carry it and each one is given room: input levels (black/white) as an extract across the opening, glow on footage that is already backlit, and shutter under the only two fast moves in the whole edit. Clips run 1.3 to 4 seconds and dissolve at 0.55, so the two hard cuts in the middle are the only moment that feels fast. The first shot is letterboxed rather than cropped: the sign it lands on is wider than a 9:16 frame at any zoom, and a crop cuts the name in half. No two neighbouring clips share a camera move.",
